{"version":1,"content":"<p>據DigiTimes援引供應鏈消息報道，<strong>馬斯克正在重新評估Terafab晶片工廠的推進方案，並可能與台積電重新展開談判。</strong>與此前僅考慮向台積電出租部分廠區不同，最新討論或賦予台積電更大的項目參與權，晶圓廠由誰建設和運營將成為談判焦點。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584886.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:01:25.906985+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:48:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:21.528940+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:21.528940+00:00","content_hash":"83153fecaf131d2cd091eb43910ed06a13ac6b027cf690d318686aad71c05aaa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}